# Blitz-sport – Account Deletion

Users can permanently delete their Blitz-sport accounts directly through the mobile application.

### How to delete your account

1. Open the Blitz-sport application.
2. Sign in to your account.
3. Navigate to your Profile or Account Settings.
4. Select **Delete Account**.
5. Confirm your request.

### Data deletion

When you confirm account deletion, your account and associated personal information are permanently deleted from our systems, subject to any data retention obligations required by law.

